  "review_note": "The brief asks for a 3.3–3.6 m drive-through carport plus a full house inside the 13.5 m ONT frontage. That leaves a 9.6 m wide house, kept back 0.3 m from the east party wall so the eaves stay on the plot. The future lift shaft (1.6 × 1.6 m) is reserved on both floors next to the stair, so a lift can go in later without structural changes. The carport is open at both ends; driving out to the garden crosses DNN land as access only, with no paving or structure there."
